✅ 推薦寫法（找出所有共有客戶的 IsSARFiled 差異）
-- 【推薦】找出 IsSARFiled 不一致的共有客戶（最實用）
SELECT 
    a.CustomerNo,
    a.CIF_KEY,
    a.IsSARFiled AS BSA_IsSARFiled,
    b.IsSARFiled AS VERIFY_IsSARFiled,
    CASE 
        WHEN a.IsSARFiled IS NULL AND b.IsSARFiled IS NULL THEN 'Both NULL'
        WHEN a.IsSARFiled = b.IsSARFiled THEN 'Match'
        ELSE 'DIFF'
    END AS Compare_Result
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b 
    ON a.cif_key = b.cif_key
WHERE EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 
    FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP c 
    WHERE a.CIF_KEY = c.NEW_CIF_KEY
)
AND (a.IsSARFiled <> b.IsSARFiled 
     OR (a.IsSARFiled IS NULL AND b.IsSARFiled IS NOT NULL)
     OR (a.IsSARFiled IS NOT NULL AND b.IsSARFiled IS NULL))
ORDER BY a.CustomerNo;

其他常見變體
1. 全部共有客戶（方便整體檢查）
SELECT 
    a.CustomerNo,
    a.IsSARFiled AS BSA_IsSARFiled,
    b.IsSARFiled AS VERIFY_IsSARFiled,
    CASE WHEN a.IsSARFiled = b.IsSARFiled THEN 'OK' ELSE 'DIFF' END AS Status
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b ON a.cif_key = b.cif_key
WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP c WHERE a.CIF_KEY = c.NEW_CIF_KEY)
ORDER BY Status DESC, a.CustomerNo;
2. 只看差異並統計數量（最推薦先跑這個）
SELECT 
    COUNT(*) AS Total_Mismatch,
    SUM(CASE WHEN a.IsSARFiled = 1 AND b.IsSARFiled = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS BSA_1_VERIFY_0,
    SUM(CASE WHEN a.IsSARFiled = 0 AND b.IsSARFiled = 1 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS BSA_0_VERIFY_1,
    SUM(CASE WHEN a.IsSARFiled IS NULL AND b.IsSARFiled IS NOT NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS NULL_Diff
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b ON a.cif_key = b.cif_key
WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP c WHERE a.CIF_KEY = c.NEW_CIF_KEY)
AND (a.IsSARFiled <> b.IsSARFiled 
     OR a.IsSARFiled IS NULL <> b.IsSARFiled IS NULL);
3. 如果你想一次看到更多欄位做交叉比對 可以在 SELECT 裡多加幾個重要欄位，例如：
	•	a.IsPEP, b.IsPEP
	•	a.CustomerStatus, b.CustomerStatus
	•	a.RiskRating, b.RiskRating 等

建議
	1	先跑第2個統計版 → 看總共有幾筆不一致。
	2	如果有差異，再跑第1個詳細版把 CustomerNo 抓出來。
	3	IsSARFiled 是 bit 欄位的話，建議用 a.IsSARFiled <> b.IsSARFiled 搭配 NULL 判斷，比較安全。
